Bind this array to the consuming component's `@Input()` property to drive the form rendering.

You should only add, update, and remove objects from the `questions` array within the service. This approach decouples data management from UI logic, ensuring that form components remain stable while data evolves.

```typescript
// Update existing question
this.questions[0].text = 'Updated Question';

