In the template, use: `<button type="submit" [disabled]="!form.valid">Save</button>`

Define a metadata interface that encapsulates control properties and validation rules. Iterate over this array in the component to instantiate controls dynamically. This ensures scalability:

```typescript
interface ControlMetadata {
  key: string;
