import { RouterModule } from '@angular/router';

@NgModule({
  imports: [
    RouterModule.forRoot([
      // Your route definitions here
    ])
  ]
})
export class AppRoutingModule {}
```

No specific configuration flags are needed to enable this feature; it activates automatically within the Router module context.

Developers must note that native View Transitions integration is currently in developer preview. Browser support is limited as it is a relatively new feature. You should check your target browser environment before relying on these animations for production applications.

```typescript
