.counter {
  transition: transform ${this.animationDuration}ms ease;
}

.counter.increment {
  transform: scale(1.2);
  animation: increment-pulse ${this.animationDuration}ms ease;
}

@keyframes increment-pulse {
  0% { transform: scale(1); }
  50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
  100% { transform: scale(1); }
}
```

This prevents rapid-fire clicks from triggering multiple animations simultaneously.

