The notification system works as follows:
- ChangeDetectorRef.markForCheck (called by AsyncPipe)
- ComponentRef.setInput for input changes
- Updating a signal read in template (automatic notification)
- Bound host or template listener callbacks
- Attaching views marked dirty by above operations

In Zoneless mode, signals provide the primary mechanism for change detection triggers without zone.js overhead.

