Serialization waits for the first moment that all pending tasks have been removed.

For complex use-cases requiring explicit cleanup, manually add and remove a task within a try-finally block to ensure stability even on failure:

```typescript
const taskService = inject(PendingTasks);
const taskCleanup = taskService.add();
try {
